# THE SIFREI ROWS OF PISKAOT 87-92 (THE DEUTERONOMY WALK sitting 11 — CHAPTER 13, 2026-09-21; the one run): the inciter (87), the gods near and far (88 — the
# headless piska, folded in on its consonants), the five prohibitions and the hand first (89), the stoning (90), all Israel hears (91), the city heard of (92) —
# EVERY ROW READ WHOLE in both files (the whole-row rule); every quotation CUT by consonants (ch13_ink.SP_); a middah named only where the row argues by one
# (logic/MIDDOT.md, the code checked before it is typed). Speed ruling (c): CONTEXT rows terse. Chapter 12's form.
from ch13_ink import *
S = {}
def srow(p, r, verdict, prose): S[(p, r)] = (verdict, prose)

srow(87, 1, 'MATERIAL', f'"WHEN YOUR BROTHER, THE SON OF YOUR MOTHER, ENTICES YOU" (13:7) — ENTICEMENT IS ONLY ERROR, AS IT IS SAID "WHOM JEZEBEL HIS WIFE INCITED" (1 KINGS 21:25). The head row of piska 87 ({SP_(87, 1, "אין", "הסתה", "אלא", "טעות")} "enticement is only error"): THE VERB\'S SENSE from its Kings seat — THE INK: the verb\'s ONE Torah token (eighteen in the Bible, computed), Jezebel\'s the closest kin by the shelf. Fresh.')
srow(87, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'OTHERS SAY: ENTICEMENT IS ONLY PROVOCATION, AS IT IS SAID "IF THE LORD HAS INCITED YOU AGAINST ME, LET HIM ACCEPT AN OFFERING" (1 SAMUEL 26:19). ({SP_(87, 2, "אין", "הסתה", "אלא", "גרוי")} "enticement is only provocation"): THE DISPUTE on the sense — error against provocation, David\'s word to Saul the second seat. Fresh.')
srow(87, 3, 'MATERIAL', f'SINCE IT IS SAID "FATHERS SHALL NOT BE PUT TO DEATH FOR SONS" (24:16) WE LEARN THEY DO NOT TESTIFY FOR ONE ANOTHER; MIGHT THEY ALSO NOT BE CHARGED WITH INCITING ONE ANOTHER? "WHEN YOUR BROTHER, THE SON OF YOUR MOTHER, ENTICES YOU." ({SP_(87, 3, "שאין", "מעידים", "זה", "לזה")} "that they do not testify for one another"): the kin\'s disqualification as witnesses (24:16 — ahead; the English writes "Ezek.24:16", asserted) does not shield the kinsman inciter. Fresh.')
srow(87, 4, 'MATERIAL', f'"YOUR BROTHER" — THIS IS YOUR BROTHER BY YOUR FATHER. ({SP_(87, 4, "זה", "אחיך", "מאביך")} "this is your brother by your father"): THE LIST OF 13:7 READ AS AN INCLUSION TABLE (87:4-11) — every kinship a case, none exempt. Fresh.')
srow(87, 5, 'CONTEXT', f'"THE SON OF YOUR MOTHER" — THIS IS THE SON OF YOUR MOTHER. ({SP_(87, 5, "זה", "בן", "אמך")} "this is your mother\'s son"). Fresh.')
srow(87, 6, 'CONTEXT', f'"OR YOUR SON" — YOUR SON OF ANY KIND. ({SP_(87, 6, "בנך", "מכל", "מקום")} "your son in any case"). Fresh.')
srow(87, 7, 'CONTEXT', f'"OR YOUR DAUGHTER" — YOUR DAUGHTER OF ANY KIND. ({SP_(87, 7, "בתך", "מכל", "מקום")} "your daughter in any case"). Fresh.')
srow(87, 8, 'CONTEXT', f'"OR THE WIFE" — THIS IS THE BETROTHED. ({SP_(87, 8, "זו", "ארוסה")} "this is the betrothed"). Fresh.')
srow(87, 9, 'CONTEXT', f'"OF YOUR BOSOM" — THIS IS THE MARRIED. ({SP_(87, 9, "זו", "נשואה")} "this is the married"): the two words two women. Fresh.')
srow(87, 10, 'CONTEXT', f'"OR YOUR FRIEND" — THIS IS THE CONVERT. ({SP_(87, 10, "זה", "הגר")} "this is the convert"). Fresh.')
srow(87, 11, 'MATERIAL', f'"WHO IS AS YOUR OWN SOUL" — THIS IS YOUR FATHER. ({SP_(87, 11, "זה", "אביך")} "this is your father"): the one kinsman the verse does not name found in its last clause — the table completed. Fresh.')
srow(87, 12, 'CONTEXT', f'"IN SECRET" — IT TEACHES THAT THEY SAY THEIR WORDS ONLY IN SECRET (PROVERBS 7:9); BUT WORDS OF TORAH ARE SAID ONLY IN PUBLIC (PROVERBS 1:20). ({SP_(87, 12, "שאין", "אומרים", "דבריהם", "אלא", "בסתר")} "that they say their words only in secret"). Fresh.')
srow(87, 13, 'MATERIAL', f'"WHICH YOU AND YOUR FATHERS HAVE NOT KNOWN" (13:8) — R. YOSE THE GALILEAN: THIS IS A DISGRACE TO ISRAEL, FOR THE NATIONS OF THE WORLD DO NOT ABANDON WHAT THEIR FATHERS HANDED THEM, AND ISRAEL ABANDON WHAT THEIR FATHERS HANDED THEM AND GO AND SERVE IDOLS. ({SP_(87, 13, "הרי", "זה", "דבר", "גני", "לישראל")} "this is a disgrace to Israel"): the clause "you and your fathers" read as the tradition\'s chain — THE INK: 13:7, 28:36, 28:64 the clause\'s three seats (computed). Fresh.')

srow(88, 1, 'CONTEXT', f'"OF THE GODS OF THE PEOPLES ROUND ABOUT YOU, NEAR TO YOU" (13:8) — FROM THE NEAR YOU KNOW WHAT THE FAR ARE. The first row of THE HEADLESS PISKA 88, opening with the chapter\'s own words ({SP_(88, 1, "מהקרובים", "אתה", "יודע", "מה", "הם", "רחוקים")} "from the near you know what the far are"): the spine\'s, folded in on its consonants. Fresh.')
srow(88, 2, 'CONTEXT', f'"FROM ONE END OF THE EARTH TO THE OTHER" — THESE ARE THE SUN AND THE MOON THAT GO FROM THE WORLD\'S END TO ITS END. ({SP_(88, 2, "אלו", "חמה", "ולבנה")} "these are the sun and the moon"): the far gods the lights (84:1\'s dominion over them). Fresh.')

srow(89, 1, 'MATERIAL', f'"YOU SHALL NOT CONSENT TO HIM" (13:9) — SINCE IT IS SAID "YOU SHALL LOVE YOUR NEIGHBOR AS YOURSELF" (LEVITICUS 19:18), MIGHT YOU LOVE THIS ONE? "YOU SHALL NOT CONSENT TO HIM." The head row of piska 89 ({SP_(89, 1, "יכול", "אתה", "אוהב", "לזה")} "might you love this one"): THE FIVE PROHIBITIONS EACH AGAINST A STANDING DUTY (89:1-5) — the inciter taken out of the love of the neighbor. Fresh.')
srow(89, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'"NOR HEARKEN TO HIM" — SINCE IT IS SAID "YOU SHALL SURELY HELP WITH HIM" (EXODUS 23:5), MIGHT YOU HELP THIS ONE? "NOR HEARKEN TO HIM." ({SP_(89, 2, "יכול", "אתה", "עוזב", "עם", "זה")} "might you help with this one"): the enemy\'s ass (read at the Exodus 23 sitting) — the help owed an enemy not owed the inciter. Fresh.')
srow(89, 3, 'MATERIAL', f'"NOR SHALL YOUR EYE PITY HIM" — SINCE IT IS SAID "YOU SHALL NOT STAND BY YOUR NEIGHBOR\'S BLOOD" (LEVITICUS 19:16), MIGHT YOU NOT BE PERMITTED TO STAND BY THIS ONE\'S BLOOD? "NOR SHALL YOUR EYE PITY HIM." ({SP_(89, 3, "יכול", "אי", "אתה", "רשי", "לעמד", "על", "דמו")} "might you not be permitted to stand by his blood"): the duty to save suspended for him (the English\'s citation slips to Dt.13:9 for Leviticus 19:16 — the Hebrew right). Fresh.')
srow(89, 4, 'MATERIAL', f'"NOR SPARE" — DO NOT ARGUE FOR HIS ACQUITTAL. ({SP_(89, 4, "לא", "תלמד", "עליו", "זכות")} "do not argue merit for him"): THE COURT\'S RULE REVERSED — the defense the court owes every accused is barred for the inciter (89:4-7). Fresh.')
srow(89, 5, 'MATERIAL', f'"NOR CONCEAL HIM" — IF YOU KNOW GUILT OF HIM YOU MAY NOT BE SILENT. ({SP_(89, 5, "אי", "אתה", "רשי", "לשתוק")} "you may not be silent"): the witness bound to speak. Fresh.')
srow(89, 6, 'MATERIAL', f'WHENCE THAT IF HE LEFT THE COURT CONVICTED THEY DO NOT BRING HIM BACK TO ACQUIT? "FOR KILL." ({SP_(89, 6, "שאין", "מחזירים", "אותו", "לזכות")} "that they do not bring him back for acquittal"): the infinitive absolute\'s first half. Fresh.')
srow(89, 7, 'MATERIAL', f'IF HE LEFT ACQUITTED, WHENCE THAT THEY BRING HIM BACK TO CONVICT? "YOU SHALL KILL HIM." ({SP_(89, 7, "שמחזירים", "אותו", "לחובה")} "that they bring him back for conviction"): the doubled verb\'s second half — the capital procedure (Mishnah Sanhedrin 4:1: back for acquittal, not for conviction) INVERTED for the inciter; the English\'s note Mekhilta Kaspa 20 the parallel. Fresh.')
srow(89, 8, 'MATERIAL', f'"YOUR HAND SHALL BE ON HIM" (13:10) — A COMMANDMENT IN THE HAND OF THE ENTICED TO PUT HIM TO DEATH; WHENCE THAT IF HE DID NOT DIE BY THE ENTICED\'S HAND HE DIES BY ANY MAN\'S? "AND THE HAND OF ALL THE PEOPLE AFTERWARD." ({SP_(89, 8, "מצוה", "ביד", "הנסת", "להמיתו")} "a commandment in the hand of the enticed to put him to death"): THE HAND FIRST — the enticed\'s duty, the people\'s after (17:7\'s witnesses\' hand the twin, seven tokens in order — computed). Fresh.')

srow(90, 1, 'MATERIAL', f'"AND YOU SHALL STONE HIM WITH STONES" (13:11) — MIGHT MANY STONES BE NEEDED? "WITH THE STONE" (LEVITICUS 20:27). IF WITH THE STONE, MIGHT ONE STONE ONLY? "WITH STONES." SAY THEN: IF HE DID NOT DIE BY THE FIRST, HE DIES BY THE SECOND. The head row of piska 90 ({SP_(90, 1, "לא", "מת", "בראשונה", "ימות", "בשניה")} "if he did not die by the first he dies by the second"): the plural and the singular reconciled into the rite (Sifrei Numbers 114 the English\'s parallel) — THE INK: Deuteronomy\'s verb of stoning against Leviticus\'s (computed: the two roots). Fresh.')
srow(90, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'"FOR HE SOUGHT TO THRUST YOU" — "THRUSTING" IS SAID HERE AND "THRUSTING" THERE (13:6): AS HERE BY STONING, SO THERE BY STONING. ({SP_(90, 2, "מה", "הדחה", "האמורה", "כאן", "בסקילה")} "as the thrusting said here is by stoning"): I2 (checked) — 86:6\'s analogy run from this end: the inciter\'s stoning lends the prophet his death. Fresh.')
srow(90, 3, 'CONTEXT', f'"FROM THE LORD YOUR GOD WHO BROUGHT YOU OUT" — EVEN HAD HE NO CLAIM BUT THAT HE BROUGHT YOU OUT OF THE LAND OF EGYPT, OUT OF THE HOUSE OF BONDAGE, ENOUGH. ({SP_(90, 3, "שהוציאך", "מארץ", "מצרים", "מבית", "עבדים")} "that He brought you out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of bondage"): 86:4 again at the preamble\'s form. Fresh.')

srow(91, 1, 'MATERIAL', f'"AND ALL ISRAEL SHALL HEAR AND FEAR" (13:12) — THEY KEEP HIM UNTIL THE FESTIVAL AND PUT HIM TO DEATH AT THE FESTIVAL, AS IT IS SAID "AND ALL THE PEOPLE SHALL HEAR AND FEAR" — R. AKIVA\'S WORDS. The head row of piska 91 ({SP_(91, 1, "משמרים", "אותו", "עד", "הרגל")} "they keep him until the festival"): THE FORMULA\'S FIRST SEAT read for its PUBLIC — the execution timed to the festival (the proof-text 17:13\'s form "all the people", ahead; Mishnah Sanhedrin 11:4 the answer sheet at 11b). Fresh.')
srow(91, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'R. JUDAH: THEY DO NOT DELAY JUDGMENT IN COURT; I HAVE ONLY THIS ONE. ({SP_(91, 2, "אין", "מענים", "בבית", "דין")} "they do not delay judgment in court"): THE DISPUTE on the timing — a festival\'s delay against no delay (the English\'s note: Tosefta Sanhedrin 11:7); the compile\'s PARAMETER. Fresh.')
srow(91, 3, 'MATERIAL', f'WHENCE FOR ONE WHO SAYS "I WILL SERVE", "I WILL GO AND SERVE", "LET US GO AND SERVE", "I WILL SACRIFICE" … "I WILL BOW DOWN", "LET US GO AND BOW DOWN"? "THEY SHALL NOT DO AGAIN SUCH AN EVIL THING" — NOT LIKE THE THING, NOT LIKE THE EVIL, NOT LIKE THIS. ({SP_(91, 3, "מנין", "לאומר", "אעבד", "אלך", "ואעבד")} "whence for one who says I will serve, I will go and serve"): THE FIFTEEN FORMS OF THE SEDUCER\'S SPEECH — five acts, three persons each — a decision table of utterances, each the same offense (the verse\'s three nouns three inclusions). Fresh.')
srow(91, 4, 'MATERIAL', f'MIGHT EVEN ONE WHO EMBRACES, KISSES, SWEEPS, WASHES, ANOINTS, CLOTHES, SHOES OR WRAPS AN IDOL BE STONED? "THIS" — THIS ONE BY STONING, AND NOT ALL THESE BY STONING. ({SP_(91, 4, "זה", "בסקילה", "ואין", "כל", "אלו", "בסקילה")} "this one by stoning and none of these by stoning"): the eight acts of honor NOT capital (Mishnah Sanhedrin 7:6 the answer sheet) — the inciter\'s stoning bounded by "this". Fresh.')

srow(92, 1, 'CONTEXT', f'"WHEN YOU HEAR" (13:13) — AND NOT ONE WHO GOES BACK AND PROBES. The head row of piska 92 ({SP_(92, 1, "ולא", "החוזר", "והמצתת")} "and not one who goes back and eavesdrops"): the hearing a report received, not sought. Fresh.')
srow(92, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'MIGHT IT BE LEFT UNEXAMINED? "YOU SHALL INQUIRE, SEARCH AND ASK DILIGENTLY" — "INQUIRE" FROM THE TORAH, "SEARCH" FROM THE WITNESSES, "ASK" FROM THE DISCIPLES. ({SP_(92, 2, "ודרשת", "מן", "התורה", "וחקרת", "מן", "העדים")} "inquire from the Torah, search from the witnesses"): THE THREE VERBS THREE SOURCES (the English\'s note: absent in some manuscripts — the row stands in both files, read whole, not excluded). Fresh.')
srow(92, 3, 'MATERIAL', f'"IN ONE OF YOUR CITIES" — ONE CITY IS MADE A CONDEMNED CITY, THEY DO NOT MAKE THREE CONDEMNED CITIES; MIGHT NOT EVEN TWO? "IN ONE OF YOUR CITIES." ({SP_(92, 3, "עיר", "אחת", "עושים", "עיר", "הנדחת")} "one city they make a condemned city"): THE PARSER\'S [1] GIVEN ITS RULE — one at a time, not three, two allowed (Mishnah Sanhedrin 1:5 the answer sheet; Tosefta 14:1). Fresh.')
srow(92, 4, 'CONTEXT', f'"WHICH THE LORD YOUR GOD GIVES YOU" — IN ANY PLACE. ({SP_(92, 4, "בכל", "מקום")} "in any place"). Fresh.')
srow(92, 5, 'MATERIAL', f'"TO DWELL THERE" — EXCLUDING JERUSALEM, WHICH WAS NOT GIVEN FOR A DWELLING. ({SP_(92, 5, "פרט", "לירושלם")} "excluding Jerusalem" — the defective spelling, chapter 12\'s lesson 5): THE CITY THAT CANNOT BE CONDEMNED — "to dwell there" the Torah\'s one seat (computed), read as the tribes\' dwelling that Jerusalem is not (the place of chapter 12 outside the ban). Fresh.')

assert sorted(S) == [(87, r) for r in range(1, 14)] + [(88, r) for r in range(1, 3)] + [(89, r) for r in range(1, 9)] + [(90, r) for r in range(1, 4)] + [(91, r) for r in range(1, 5)] + [(92, r) for r in range(1, 6)], sorted(S)
